      "finding": "R2-F2",
      "reason": "True but not for this plan: the status line of an accepted decision names the accepter by git identity, as docs/decisions/README.md requires, with the no-reply address that every commit of the project already carries and the remote already publishes. It is a convention of the project, not a defect of this plan, and removing it would be a change to an accepted record."
    }
